    "tree_id": "b15d3f6c45d0f63fc949f26e7bb9ad6668991f76",
    "message": "test: canonical AiOS matrix (manifest + verifier + runner) and reproducible CI\n\n- tests/matrix/manifest.json: the 46 canonical cases (45 SQL + G4) with ids, domains,\n  titles, assertions and the verbatim source assertion strings from a5b6df6.\n- tests/matrix/verify.py: fails on ANY drift (missing/extra/duplicate/renamed/moved/\n  failing case; missing, failing or reordered G4 check). A green matrix means exactly\n  the 46 canonical cases ran and passed.\n- tests/matrix/run.sh: single entry point (05 + G4 + verify), writes logs and\n  report.json. 05 now also emits machine-readable MX_RESULT lines.\n- ci.yml: pin Deno 2.9.8 and Supabase CLI 2.122.0 (were `v2.x` / `latest`); always\n  print test logs (passing runs previously left no per-test evidence); canonical\n  matrix step replaces the standalone G4 step and runs even if the generic SQL step\n  fails; evidence uploaded as an artifact; step summary table; workflow_dispatch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019DFG8DuRnxSGJgpZYjQowj",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-02T07:11:43Z",
